message: "If you use this dataset or rule library, please cite it using this metadata."
type: dataset
title: "Bio Constitution Rules"
abstract: >
  A research dataset containing 30 machine-readable decision rules for
  biological dual-use content across six domains and a 1,063-record synthetic,
  rule-derived text-classification corpus. The labels are not independently
  expert validated and the artifact is not a production safeguard.
authors:
